<title>BELGIUM: Belgian CBR jumps further on buy advice.</title>
<headline>Belgian CBR jumps further on buy advice.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian cement maker CBR SA, recently singled out by analysts as one of their market favourites, jumped more than three percent to a new all-time high on Monday.</p>
<p>At 1005 GMT, CBR was up 3.0 percent at 3,050 francs after earlier touching 3,090 but dealers said the stock, which has risen about nine percent since January 2, was rapidly becoming expensive.</p>
<p>&quot;CBR is more and more expensive, it is too late to buy,&quot; said Damien Crispiels at Banque Degroof.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
